Then thou canst laugh at thy friends as they die.  All with the power of thy voice and thy magic wand!\n\nThou canst unlock new mage ranks by successfully killing other monkes!  Can thou become a Grand Master?\n\nMonke Mages doth come with 5 free spells and 1 free map, and thou canst unlock all 12 spells and the magic arena map for only one of thine dollars!\n\nBut be careful oh precious monke, in the magic arena thou mayest also summon enemies that will crush thee with a somewhat large hammer or bite thee many times without reproach. \n\nDoth ye have what it doth take to be a monke mage?", "short_description": "Cast spells using your voice and become the ultimate monke mage!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/monkemages/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Red Team Interactive", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mystical-mote-389916.web.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "26341133992165531"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2521231878326341"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2521231878326341"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1774369020, "status"